OL,6,CG2022FThe final edition of Neighbours
OL,7,F(original series) airs on Channel 5.
OL,8,
OL,9,FThe programme had been on UK TV since
OL,10,FOctober 1986. The final edition was
OL,11,Fshown the previous evening in
OL,12,FAustralia.
OL,13,
OL,14,FMany former cast members returned -
OL,15,Fmost notably Jason Donovan, Kylie
OL,16,FMinogue and Guy Pearce.
